{"id":"n5-121","title":"なんでも～ (nandemo～)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Means 'any', 'anything', 'anyone'.","longExplanation":"The なんでも grammar point is used to express the concept of 'any', 'anything', or 'anyone' in Japanese. It can be used with verbs, adjectives, and nouns. It is often used in the meaning of 'no matter what' or 'regardless of'.","formation":"なんでも + Verb / なんでも + Adjective / なんでも + Noun","examples":[{"jp":"なんでも食べられるから、何を頼んでも大丈夫です。","romaji":"Nandemo taberareru kara, nani wo tanondemo daijoubu desu.","en":"I can eat anything, so it's okay to order whatever you want.","words":[{"surface":"なん","vocabId":"1460830","reading":"なん"},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"られる","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"頼ん","vocabId":"1548370","reading":"たのむ","baseForm":"頼む"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"大丈夫","vocabId":"1414150","reading":"だいじょうぶ"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"なんでもよければ、この本をおすすめします。","romaji":"Nandemo yokereba, kono hon wo osusume shimasu.","en":"If you're okay with anything, I recommend this book.","words":[{"surface":"なん","vocabId":"1460830","reading":"なん"},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"よけれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"よい"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"おすすめ","vocabId":"1002150","reading":"おすすめ"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"なんでもできるスタッフを探しています。","romaji":"Nandemo dekiru sutaffu wo sagashiteimasu.","en":"We are looking for a staff member who can do anything.","words":[{"surface":"なん","vocabId":"1460830","reading":"なん"},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"できる","vocabId":"1340450","reading":"できる"},{"surface":"スタッフ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"探し","vocabId":"1593670","reading":"さがす","baseForm":"探す"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,1]},{"jp":"この食堂では、なんでも美味しくて安い料理が出されます。","romaji":"Kono shokudou de wa, nandemo oishikute yasui ryouri ga dasaremasu.","en":"In this cafeteria, any dish served is delicious and inexpensive.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食堂","vocabId":"1358550","reading":"しょくどう"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なん","vocabId":"1460830","reading":"なん"},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しく","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい","baseForm":"美味しい"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"安い","vocabId":"1153670","reading":"やすい"},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出さ","vocabId":"1338180","reading":"だす","baseForm":"出す"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]}]}